{"id":"a370030f-c189-421f-a453-9178437e1cb4","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"6740cc4498ff957b","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/bridge/extension.ts","baseline":{"blob":"1f17a1682f5322e57de61c792659c9749a44f1fc","start":9854,"end":10399},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","started","=","await","vscode",".","debug",".","startDebugging","(","undefined",",","{","\"","type","\"",":","\"","tsval","\"",",","\"","request","\"",":","\"","launch","\"",",","\"","name","\"",":","`","node ","${","info",".","file",".","split","(","\"","/","\"",")",".","pop","(",")","??","info",".","file","}","","`",",","\"","program","\"",":","info",".","file",",","...","info",".","args","!==","undefined","&&","info",".","args",".","length",">","0","?","{","\"","args","\"",":","info",".","args","}",":","{","}",",","...","info",".","cwd","===","undefined","?","{","}",":","{","\"","cwd","\"",":","info",".","cwd","}",",","...","info",".","env","===","undefined","?","{","}",":","{","\"","env","\"",":","info",".","env","}",",","\"","internalConsoleOptions","\"",":","\"","neverOpen","\"",",","\"","__runId","\"",":","info",".","runId",",","\"","__startedBy","\"",":","\"","terminal","\"","}",",","{","\"","suppressDebugView","\"",":","true",",","...","info",".","noDebug","===","true","?","{","\"","noDebug","\"",":","true","}",":","{","}","}",")"]},"context":{"before":"71be9986199e9150#11","after":"7d8d22a89634120f"}},"payload":{"text":"`__startedBy`: the terminal shows this run itself, and is its output and stdin (RUNNING.md, *Output goes\nwhere it was started*) — with the command line's arguments, its directory and its environment. Focus stays\nthere: no Run and Debug view, no Debug Console opened (a breakpoint still stops it, and shows where).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:15:17.794Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:15:17.794Z"}
{"id":"b96213c4-d383-446e-8985-11d85b8001eb","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"6a06cb4c79efffdc","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/bridge/extension.ts","baseline":{"blob":"3c564259976daa35755c41461da991cddc55709e","start":2480,"end":2531},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","incoming","=","new","vscode",".","EventEmitter","<","unknown",">","(",")"]},"context":{"before":"a095e4b316c3a4fc","after":"3365f60777592c92"}},"payload":{"text":"The bridge->root UPLINK. The ext host is an isolated `extension-file://` realm with no window path to the\npage, so bridgeHub can't use windowTransport. Instead it rides the extension's EXPORTED API (spike-verified:\next-host EventEmitter events + functions marshal bidirectionally to the workbench): bridgeHub links a\ntransport whose `send` fires an event the workbench receives, and whose `listen` is fed by a function the\nworkbench calls. workbench-entry links its own hub to `toWorkbench`/`fromWorkbench` and relays to the top\npage over windowTransport. Standalone (no export consumer) → bridgeHub is just a root; the bridge still works.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:15:45.624Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:15:45.624Z"}
{"id":"cb57ed3a-0707-4b68-8251-6c529fdb114c","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"c23d1d6f2c6f0b17","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/bridge/extension.ts","baseline":{"blob":"e2d7ac28aad12418898827ca5e54963c4487f8cd","start":5478,"end":5529},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","seen","=","new","Map","<","string",",","Map","<","string",",","number",">",">","(",")"]},"context":{"before":"c6592c22590db579","after":"0b43902300249085"}},"payload":{"text":"Each extension host's command totals (extensions/command-tap.ts): the extensions, and the commands between them, on\nthe architecture view — discovered, not declared (ARCHITECTURE.md, *Discovered, not declared*). A host sends its totals; what's new\nsince its last is put on the view as that many calls.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:15:27.864Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:15:27.864Z"}
{"id":"d439024c-eb31-4892-a3dd-884135597685","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"a6d827680d545722","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/bridge/extension.ts","baseline":{"blob":"6a094565c2965440d3d5819758095ef061865976","start":9222,"end":9303},"shape":{"type":"If","atoms":["if","(","typeof","runId","===","\"","string","\"",")","{","debugSessionsByRunId",".","delete","(","runId",")",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"97567500668546ab#1","after":"2ad383e4ee2f53e3"}},"payload":{"text":"(its run's end, with its exit code, is debug-events.ts')","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:15:21.850Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:15:21.850Z"}
{"id":"d8042bc4-3809-4f8b-bae9-e7294c2804e2","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"00c230c2b6e3d8a9","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/bridge/extension.ts","baseline":{"blob":"3a773d7fc2a3883b1104a95191a2d7bee046f70b","start":3864,"end":3907},"shape":{"type":"CallExpression","atoms":["provideWorkspaceRuntime","(","workspaceRuntime","(",")",")"]},"context":{"before":"2ec5e557eb615e4e","after":"89ff7ea8d3614964"}},"payload":{"text":"The workspace runtime, for any debugger in this extension host (ARCHITECTURE.md, *Extension points* 2; editor-api's\n`workspaceRuntime()`): tsval's — an extension of its own, extensions/tsval — with the workspace's buffer, ours. Its\nworkers' file calls are answered by runtime-fs.ts, a debugger's anywhere (the web worker host's come by core's\nbootstrap there).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:15:41.758Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:15:41.758Z"}
{"id":"dd0817a1-e52c-428b-964d-00313beb3dd9","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"217f4d6dd9b8eb1e","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/bridge/extension.ts","baseline":{"blob":"2af15abe1b0ed90e24eab84aa77b9c5eda4d4c12","start":11288,"end":11558},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","attachWorkspaceBuffer","=","(","buffer",":","unknown",")",":","void","=>","{","if","(","typeof","SharedArrayBuffer","===","\"","undefined","\"","||","!","(","buffer","instanceof","SharedArrayBuffer",")",")","{","return",";","}","workspace",".","buffer","=","buffer",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"929892e7c711f08a","after":"c8d8a676cfdf2977"}},"payload":{"text":"The bridge->workbench half of the uplink, as this extension's EXPORTS: workbench-entry links its hub to\n`toWorkbench` (ext host → workbench) and `fromWorkbench` (workbench → ext host).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:15:15.768Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:15:15.768Z"}
{"id":"dd84df6f-5529-485b-9d2c-a24cbdf5e1ee","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"34b0abe1110cfc3e","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/bridge/extension.ts","baseline":{"blob":"6a4c67bc473b6c2a4a41e51bd18e53fc8bc4a3b5","start":1444,"end":1616},"shape":{"type":"ExportDeclaration","atoms":["export","interface","BridgeExports","{","\"","toWorkbench","\"",":","vscode",".","Event","<","unknown",">",";","\"","fromWorkbench","\"",":","(","message",":","unknown",")","=>","void",";","\"","attachWorkspaceBuffer","\"",":","(","buffer",":","unknown",")","=>","void",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"b2b25f3767116f07","after":"7c280ccd7a35a235"}},"payload":{"text":"This extension's exports — the bridge->workbench half of the hub uplink (ext host is an isolated realm, so it\nrides the exported API rather than a window transport). See activate + workbench-entry's bridge.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:15:51.491Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:15:51.491Z"}
